Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.03,0:00:08.11,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,75)}It's all right! Now let's move forward
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.37,0:00:11.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,with the sun always in our hearts
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.76,0:00:15.03,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,As power passes through our clasped hands
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.18,0:00:18.68,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's grab hold of our wishes{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.30,0:00:31.85,OP11 Credits,,50,0,230,,Translation\N FUNimation
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.32,0:00:32.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Working together, let's ride the giant waves{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.55,0:00:37.02,OP11 Credits,,450,0,280,,Soundtracking\NHalee
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.55,0:00:37.02,OP11 Credits,,0,460,350,,Infoboxes/Title Card\N BernieCrane
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.85,0:00:40.33,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}Let's hurry toward the excitement--\Nthere's the starting signal{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.14,0:00:41.03,OP11 Credits,,0,100,420,,Editing\NFeeso
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.01,0:00:47.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now's the time to set sail-- let's raise anchor{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.51,0:00:47.12,OP11 Credits,,470,0,300,,Quality Checking\N Alasta\NGalaxy 9000\NMr. Luffy
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.99,0:00:55.00,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}Cut through the rainbow-colored wind\Nand head for a sea of adventure{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.13,0:00:58.57,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It'll be a journey fraught with injury{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:01:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's important that there\Nis a place where there is?.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.65,0:01:02.30,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but what you cherish most will be right there{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.50,0:01:06.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And if you get into a jam{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.50,0:01:06.47,OP11 Credits,,0,30,410,,Timing\NDatenshi
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.51,0:01:08.38,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll always be there to protect you{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.18,0:01:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, let's go ahead and go ahead!.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.51,0:01:13.36,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's all right! Now let's move forward{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moon will always come to the moon!.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.71,0:01:16.85,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}with the sun always in our hearts{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moon will come to the moon!.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.23,0:01:20.35,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}If a storm hits, let's put\Nour arms around each other{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's look at the light of the stars?.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.46,0:01:24.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,0)}{\i1}and gaze at the light beyond{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.72,0:01:27.97,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we gather up the pieces of our dreams{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.46,0:01:31.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they'll make a map leading to tomorrow{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.72,0:01:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you next time.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.73,0:01:34.75,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So let's grab hold of our wishes{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.20,0:01:40.48,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}under the same flag-- together, we're one{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.47,0:01:56.00,Title,,0,0,420,,{\fad(250,250)}Combat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.46,0:01:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.68,0:02:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right! We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.34,0:02:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.17,0:02:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so big! He's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.28,0:02:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't have him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.50,0:02:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.58,0:02:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you! Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys are amazing! Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.43,0:02:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.35,0:02:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I've moved to tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it your best in the\Nthird round, too. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about, you traitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.84,0:02:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's ever beaten the Groggy monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, ref. Wakey-wakey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you better make your\Ncall. Go ahead. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.70,0:02:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that last move was a flagrant\Nfoul if I've ever seen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.42,0:02:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's out of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.12,0:03:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the final whistle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you have it, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The groggy ring match is officially over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the end of an era.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The groggy monsters have\Nfinally been dethroned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the kings of the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.42,0:03:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our new champions and\Nwinners of the second round.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are Zoro and Sanji of\Nthe Straw Hat Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you think would happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like our guys would never lose to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.22,0:03:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was I great?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.52,0:03:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were just wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't scare me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you followed\Nmy plan after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think you had\Nsomething to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.27,0:03:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as I'm sure you all know,\Nat the end of our fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.88,0:04:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our winners, the Straw Hat Pirates,\Ncan claim their hard-earned prize!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will they take a member of Foxy's crew,\Nor will they take his Jolly Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, it's up to their\Ncaptain and their captain alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, drumroll, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the choice is obvious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean he's going to pick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They want me, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.06,0:04:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've wanted me this\Nwhole time. My heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart isn't ready to\Nsay farewell yet. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's looking this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.28,0:04:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet it'll be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.14,0:04:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll put a smile on my face for my\Nfriends, even if I'm crying on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to be so lovable?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, I choose. Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.41,0:04:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their boss is probably going to\Ntake part in the next round, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, we'd all like to get Chopper back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we end up losing the next round,\Nthen they'll probably take him right back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and our win would go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since his crew will be dumbstruck
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.34,0:05:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when they lose their precious boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're guaranteed to keep\Nhim for good, get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, say it isn't so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're really gonna\Ntake our captain away?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's the peanut strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are the lowest of the low.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go home, lousy peanuters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid to fight us fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.86,0:05:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although there's no rule\Nagainst this strategy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it certainly seems a bit underhanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.44,0:05:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little cheating is expected of pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but suddenly taking a cruise\Ncaptain away in the middle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.78,0:05:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of a game is no different\Nthan running from a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shame on you Straw Hats\Nand shame on the heartless
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.22,0:05:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,devil of a woman who\Ncame up with this plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're truly a nefarious navigator, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.64,0:05:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you talk trash about Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Outta fillet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they so mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.30,0:05:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, even if it doesn't\Ngo against the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:06:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it does seem to go against some\Nof their pirate sensibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.82,0:06:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with Nami on this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.64,0:06:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think they're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.66,0:06:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, why don't you grow a backbone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just making a big\Nfuss because you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you shut up and deal with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.44,0:06:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am, we're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Underhanded witch, though\Nshe is, the girl is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.84,0:06:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loopy is the captain of the winning team,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.10,0:06:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's up to him to decide\Nhow this battle will unfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is to say, he's free to choose\Nanyone he likes, including Foxy himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.69,0:06:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's picking me for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.20,0:06:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how you slice it, I'm\Nthe only choice that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they're gonna pick me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew these guys were cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, just a quick thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That plan of yours, although it\Nwould give us a big advantage,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you realize it would also make\NFoxy a part of our crew. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'll pass. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.38,0:06:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that the Straw Hats are done\Nemotionally abusing our boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's time for them to make their decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't leave us\Nin suspense any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, there's\Nsomeone I want to take back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Chopper, get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.02,0:07:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, you better know me that time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll miss you, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.98,0:07:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.84,0:07:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you won!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bunch of suckers like that\Ncould never beat my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.47,0:07:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our sweet captain's heart has been crushed\Nunder the weight of those cruel words!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one thing to turn him down, but\Ndid they have to do it like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, it's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if they don't want you, we still do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.98,0:07:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're always welcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.36,0:07:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody makes fun of our\Nboss and gets away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get him next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't let you down, boss, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.88,0:07:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.64,0:07:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave us, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll never leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only crew for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:08:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as a fair warning, nobody has ever\Nbeen able to beat me in the combat round.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.74,0:08:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can beat me in a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, and maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this isn't a fight, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.88,0:08:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rick finally arrives at the combat round!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.38,0:08:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before we start, we must\Ndecide on the battlefield!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two competitors spin\Nthis unbiased cannon,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and wherever it stops is the\Nplace where they'll do combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The match hasn't even started yet,\Nand you guys are cheating already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The battlefield has been set!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And would you look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.18,0:08:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By sheer coincidence, it's\Non the deck of the Sexy Foxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now you're just rubbing\Nit in, you little liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.06,0:08:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moving right along, let's\Nexplain the rules of combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.72,0:08:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything within 50 meters\Nof where the cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,landed is considered\Npart of the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.52,0:08:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, it's a 100-meter-wide circle\Nmeasuring from the center of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.64,0:09:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weapons and anything else found inside\Nthe designated battlefield are allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, outside crew members are\Nstrictly forbidden from entering the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock your opponent out of\Nbounds and you win the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.16,0:09:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.08,0:09:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, as long as you're in the circle\Nfighting in the air or water is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foxy, Foxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.80,0:09:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While we're busy preparing\Nfor the main event,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Porch's lovely flower cheerleaders\Nare performing on the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's not your thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.48,0:09:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can also check out a warm-up match\Nbeing held on the front of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.98,0:09:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as always,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our Association of Stalls is selling a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.14,0:09:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,limited edition Davey-backed\Nbite merchandise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be sure to check that out as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody wants your junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just start the match already.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.96,0:09:43.38,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: "Foxy Pins"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.90,0:09:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here you go, fellas, two\Nlimited edition Foxy Pins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you seen enough of his young face?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.01,0:09:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's your captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now take him before he\Nbuys something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.56,0:09:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to pay so much for\Nyour crappy popcorn and cola?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't like the price,\Nhow about you don't buy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me 50 % off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:09:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That cannon means the\Npreparations are complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if the opening entertainment\Ncould please leave the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now it's time for the main event.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fighters are in place and\Nthe bell is ready to sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab a seat in the spectator\Nstands before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.92,0:10:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cloudy all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today we have a real treat,\Nladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.50,0:10:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Captain vs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Showdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, in the left corner, we\Nhave a reigning Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man among men who never\Nturns down a challenge
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that boasts a legendary\Ncombat record of 920 wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.82,0:10:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our one and only boss,\Nthe Silver Fox Boxer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.88,0:10:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You listen up, Luffy,\Nand you listen up good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.48,0:10:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ain't your old self no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You put that boy to bed, and now\Nyou're gone and woken up a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.24,0:10:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like that hairstyle's\Nwoken up your wild side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.28,0:11:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since the dawn of time, man has\Nwondered if the champion makes the afro,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.92,0:11:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or the afro makes the champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's a question even\Nmodern science can't answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.64,0:11:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen, with that afro on your head,\Nyour fists are weapons of mass destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strawhead's too scared to come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the right corner, our challenger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hailing from the east blue\Nwith a tiny crew of only seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a massive 100 million Berry bounty,\Nthe rubber wonder they call Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mountain Davey! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Luffy is sporting a larger-than-life\Nafro with a personality to match.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, looking sharp, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Luffy's cooler than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fighters have entered the battlefield\Nand look like they're ready to rumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.74,0:11:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that Luffy has turned in\Nhis Straw Hat for a mighty afro,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:12:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does he have the power to protect the pride\Nof his crew and unborn children alike?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or will Foxy's undefeated fist strip\Nhim of all his hopes and dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.88,0:12:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only time will tell as\Nthis fateful final round
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the Davy Mac fight\Nexplodes into action!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.12,0:12:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the dressing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got to wear boxing gloves, but\Npretty much anything else goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is more like a costume\Nshop than a dressing room, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I can't pick a favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.78,0:12:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it'd be okay if\NI just wore all of it at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I cool now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.90,0:12:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat, I'm really\Ndiggin' the new lug!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.56,0:13:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, Usa, pull a quick\Nbait with your left!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.80,0:13:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then slap that chin with\Na golden uppercut! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So funky, I can feel that child\Nlightin' a fire in my soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, this is what happens when\Nyou leave Luffy alone with Usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.60,0:13:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me try to show some dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.40,0:13:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might be the champ, but\Nthis one's got some bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.86,0:13:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's out of sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.92,0:13:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You best get ready to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because this one-two punch\Nis going to give you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Corner Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to take your\Nsideshow to the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was really getting my groove on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't make me leave already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.92,0:13:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manager out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off with the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.02,0:13:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since I'm not needed here\Neither, I'll be on my merry way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get this and started.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.38,0:13:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stands are moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.76,0:13:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got to get chairs like that on my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.36,0:13:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, Luffy, what do you\Nsay you and I have a little fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.74,0:13:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole ship is our\Nplayground, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.58,0:13:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel free to go as wild as you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we have plenty of skilled\Nshipwrights to clean up after our mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.46,0:14:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the opponents face off atop the\Nfabulous figurehead of the sexy Foxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.28,0:14:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which was chosen by sheer\Ncoincidence, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of fearsome flying\Nfists will be unfurled today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't let that\Nwinning streak stop now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.66,0:14:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, don't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all that matters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.52,0:14:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just watch out for his beam, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excitement fills the stands in the\Nfinal seconds before the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's plunder or be plundered. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Silver Fox Foxy\Nversus the Gum-Gum Jatling Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a one-round\Nbout with no time limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as they stay in\Nbounds, Everything goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fighters are ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there goes the bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you! Go on, go!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.25,0:14:56.57,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum... Pistol!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.25,0:14:56.07,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow-Slow Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.94,0:14:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow, slow, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.54,0:15:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My arm is fast, but my fist is all slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't expect me to be\Nafraid of a rubber hose, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.59,0:15:18.81,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow-Slow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.34,0:15:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow, slow, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fooled you!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.47,0:15:24.59,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow-Slow Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.80,0:15:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow, slow, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.54,0:15:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, he's floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.42,0:15:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that means he falls slow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told him to watch out for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't he listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.10,0:15:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know there's no time limit, but come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.60,0:15:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you spare us both and give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.21,0:15:58.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Nine-Tails Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.52,0:15:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine tails around!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.25,0:16:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our boss on Gleasius' signature\Nattack right off the bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stronghead is helpless to fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not budging an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.42,0:16:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, look closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.90,0:16:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just moving in slow motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider that a preview of what's to come,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.20,0:16:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though, to your credit, it seems like\Nyou can take a punch pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I've got plenty\Nof other tricks up my sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.92,0:16:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, your 30 seconds are about up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.08,0:16:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's falling overboard. No, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That slow, slow beam is going to\Ngive me more trouble than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:17:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, beams sure are cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.74,0:17:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, I've got to be more careful\Nwhere I stretch my arms now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.80,0:17:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd that jerk run off to, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you sneak up on\Nme with your beam, Splithead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.86,0:17:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on and fight like a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand your frustration,\Nbut don't take it out on the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.34,0:17:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he use his beam?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the sexy boxy, Rubber Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.48,0:17:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a dirty trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.80,0:17:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down for a second, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.70,0:17:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm trying to\Nshow you some hospitality here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.78,0:17:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those cannonballs are\Nmoving in slow-mo, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you can ride\Non one, then so can't I!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.74,0:17:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't touch that one if I were you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:17:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, and that one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't say I didn't warn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's his problem anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he keeps this up, he's\Ngonna sink his own ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.98,0:18:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll sink you first!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.83,0:18:23.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow-Slow Foxy Face Bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow, slow, foxy-faced bomb tenor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, they're pins.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sure are a lot bigger\Nthan the one I bought, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course we're bigger, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because we're bomb-stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.50,0:18:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is a bomb talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the real thing, that's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My punches weren't quite doing the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I upgraded my gloves, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and fair warning, those\Nbombs are about to go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.46,0:19:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Body blue! Body blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.18,0:19:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on with\Nthe fight down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I don't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A series of powerful\Nexplosions rocks our ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.80,0:19:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which just so happens\Nto be the battlefield!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.58,0:19:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The likely cause of some foxy merchandise\Nthat just happens to be explosive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.10,0:19:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this cheating just so\Nhappens to be pissing me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.28,0:19:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder that jerk's never lost a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.40,0:19:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loopy, speak to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.44,0:19:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.72,0:19:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using his surroundings to his advantage,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our boss slammed Straw Hat head-on with\Na strategically placed cannon attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.70,0:19:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I can see is smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.82,0:19:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was Straw Hat blown to smithereens?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:19:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:20:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, Foxy's onslaught was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.12,0:20:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You're annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.28,0:20:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.94,0:20:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.30,0:20:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.46,0:20:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He somehow abated the explosive\Nattack at point-blank range!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.54,0:20:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What amazing speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.16,0:20:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 100 million Barry Rubber\NBoy is truly a thing of wonder!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.96,0:20:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the power of the frog!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.00,0:20:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like our boss's next\Nattack is already underway!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.02,0:20:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could it be plotting this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sneaky foxy lets out an unsettling\Nlaugh from behind a thick screen of smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.70,0:20:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Straw Hat stares\Ncluelessly into the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.52,0:21:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The suspense is killing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.44,0:21:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is our boss hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how'd you like that? You had enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got blown up twice as bad as me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, I'm fine! See?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.87,0:21:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't look fine at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.26,0:21:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even want you on my crew anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather just crush you.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.47,0:21:27.39,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow-Slow Beam--!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.80,0:21:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow, slow me!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.65,0:21:28.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum Hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.46,0:21:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum, gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.26,0:21:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to break your arm so you\Ncan't hit me with those dumb beads.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.48,0:21:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.39,0:21:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this guy want to fight or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.24,0:21:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.22,0:21:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just a cutout?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.73,0:21:46.94,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow-Slow Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.28,0:21:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow, slow beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.78,0:21:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey! Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.38,0:22:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one is the real me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.24,0:22:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which direction will the beam come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.30,0:22:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.60,0:22:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all look the same, just a bunch of\Nsplit heads with stupid-looking haircuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.86,0:22:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now a stupid-looking split head?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.16,0:22:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.16,0:22:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.20,0:22:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be a cheater, but\Nat least I have a heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in for it now! Look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.30,0:22:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.46,0:22:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it! A trap door!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.50,0:22:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for keeping\Nyour head in the clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.18,0:22:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who told me to\Nlook up in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.96,0:22:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.10,0:22:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better look down, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.50,0:22:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is the floor moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.28,0:22:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fuck! It's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.58,0:22:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he falls in the water, he's done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.38,0:23:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you can't let\Nthe fight ends this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.36,0:23:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can get rid of me that easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.28,0:23:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Close call!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.04,0:23:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be any fun if Boss\Nknocked him out right off the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.62,0:23:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.32,0:23:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After power!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship's a pain in\Nthe butt! What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.92,0:23:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Splithead, where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.26,0:23:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.98,0:23:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's narrow escape didn't\Nseem to impress this foxy pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.36,0:23:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might even say it's laughing at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.18,0:23:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.46,0:23:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cabin of the ship\Nis Foxy's playground.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.78,0:23:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will Luffy be lured inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.24,0:23:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Luffy, it's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.26,0:23:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, do not go in that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.52,0:23:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to beat that jerk's brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.14,0:23:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat throws caution to the\Nwind and dashes inside the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.52,0:23:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that means I can't\Ngive you play-by-play anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.62,0:23:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think it's safe to\Nassume that whatever's
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.54,0:23:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going on in there is completely amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.02,0:24:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.68,0:24:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to put those\Nwings to the Tesla bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.08,0:24:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So spread them and fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.36,0:24:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These seats are bad enough\Nwithout you standing in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.26,0:24:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool. A gun deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.08,0:24:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's huge, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.46,0:24:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad Usopp isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.94,0:24:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.12,0:24:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, where'd Foxy run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.04,0:24:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha! He's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.24,0:24:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.42,0:24:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.70,0:24:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now he'll come rushing\Nthrough that door like an idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.06,0:24:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we'll see how chipper our\Nlittle rubber boy is Who in my
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.70,0:24:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,room full of two-foot steel spikes\Nmakes Swiss cheese out of him
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.94,0:24:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Straw Hat, you know you won
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.50,0:24:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's him Wow, wonder\Nwhat that room's used for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.74,0:25:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of monster fires off\Ncannons inside someone else's ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.56,0:25:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least he stopped running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.44,0:25:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You brain died!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.86,0:25:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you! Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.28,0:25:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 1,0:25:21.45,0:25:24.24,Note,,0,0,0,,"Infirmary"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.20,0:25:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back and fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.18,0:25:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he have any\Ncommon decency, honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.80,0:25:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough Foxy Face Transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.56,0:25:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.52,0:25:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.43,0:25:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear me, are you ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.26,0:25:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me where it hurts and I'll fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.22,0:25:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it your head? Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.16,0:25:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sick in the head?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.70,0:25:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.61,0:25:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see someone\Nelse come through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.44,0:25:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, no, I didn't see a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.58,0:25:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.60,0:25:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You broke something, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.58,0:25:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had a face?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.16,0:26:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I saw\Nhim go in there. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.50,0:26:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That weird lady, she looked just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.10,0:26:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.52,0:26:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you must be Foxy's sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.52,0:26:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't fool me.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:12.87,0:26:14.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Counter Fox Blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.62,0:26:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Hunter Fox. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.52,0:26:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.84,0:26:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.12,0:26:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She lied to me so I\Nwouldn't fight her brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.90,0:26:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he even trying to fight anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.88,0:26:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.72,0:26:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slice of the fish, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.62,0:26:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got some nice carpaccio.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.70,0:26:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to cut a tarot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.58,0:26:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do-re-mi-fas-or-a-ti-do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.90,0:26:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahem. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.52,0:26:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen some old\Nfox dude with his head
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.64,0:26:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,split in two that looks\Nreally stupid and not cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.38,0:26:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You truly are heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.56,0:26:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.04,0:27:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I was the woman in\Nthe doctor's office, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.44,0:27:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.35,0:27:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 1,0:27:02.85,0:27:05.09,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow-Slow Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.27,0:27:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow, slow, beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.06,0:27:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine tails.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:08.55,0:27:09.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Nine-Tails Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.86,0:27:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't just happen to\Nlure you into the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.42,0:27:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.32,0:27:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is to say, I have a surprise waiting\Nfor you after my punches take effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.50,0:27:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to guess what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.96,0:27:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing alive, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.92,0:27:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be against\Nthe rules, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.26,0:27:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't learned yet, once the\Neffect of my slow-snow beam wears off,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.86,0:27:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all those punches are\Ngoing to hit you at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.80,0:27:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it. Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.68,0:27:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're only a couple of feet\Naway from your final stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.10,0:27:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.34,0:28:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he run off to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.46,0:28:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.66,0:28:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.96,0:28:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of costume is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.36,0:28:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a costume,\Nit's a pilot's uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.34,0:28:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is my robot,\Na boxing masterpiece,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.00,0:28:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,corrected and perfected\Nthrough countless trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.30,0:28:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce you to the Gorilla Punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.84,0:28:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only gorilla I see on it is you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.92,0:28:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll have to change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.52,0:29:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.08,0:29:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you're so rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.86,0:29:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gorilla Punch, let's finish him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.80,0:29:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you get that crazy\Nthing to move anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.84,0:29:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a secret...!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.98,0:29:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure are sweating a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.68,0:29:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.64,0:29:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think you can\Ndodge, then be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.54,0:29:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But be warned, I won't\Nmake it easy for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:27.63,0:29:29.91,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow-Slow Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.18,0:29:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow, slow beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.20,0:29:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you aiming at?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.16,0:29:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.12,0:29:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is someone there? It's a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.24,0:29:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and mirrors reflect slow-mo-booters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.58,0:29:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.74,0:29:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.50,0:29:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.12,0:29:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't take the heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.70,0:29:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I forget to mention\Nthese gloves burn like fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.10,0:29:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause they do!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.01,0:30:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even Sea Kings can stand\Nthe beating from this thing!
Dialogue: 1,0:30:02.23,0:30:04.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Mirror Racket!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.70,0:30:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mirror Racket!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.84,0:30:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, that's for\Nme. It's a beam and punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.28,0:30:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Combo, I call this attack the\NSlow Poke Ball Demon. This
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.86,0:30:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.14,0:30:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a pain i gotta
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.12,0:30:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,find a way to get in closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.24,0:30:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.50,0:30:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't dodge forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.20,0:30:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.28,0:30:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beam or the machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.36,0:30:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.90,0:31:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.64,0:31:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 1,0:31:04.65,0:31:07.29,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.22,0:31:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.92,0:31:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 1,0:31:16.31,0:31:20.85,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow-Slow Beam! Beam! Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.40,0:31:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little rat.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:27.21,0:31:29.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gorilla Punch Golden Hits!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.24,0:31:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my golden hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.62,0:31:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time marches on but neither\Ncombatant has emerged
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.48,0:31:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as a winner in the final\Nround of this Daily
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.36,0:31:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back fight it's truly\Nunusual for someone to
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.86,0:31:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,last so long against\NFoxy in his own territory
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.18,0:32:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the crowd cheers for our boss\Nwith all their hearts Luffy won't lose
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.20,0:32:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well that goes without Saying he's\NLuffy and he has an afro I'd say being
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.24,0:32:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy should be more than enough though\NThe afro is nice okay you're gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.04,0:32:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have to explain this afro thing to me\Nyou're all acting like it powers him up,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.84,0:32:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.22,0:32:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this is the longest\Ncombat round I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.00,0:32:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy is made of rubber, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.92,0:32:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's made of rubber, and he has an afro.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.56,0:32:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.47,0:32:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I the only one who doesn't get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.62,0:32:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.53,0:32:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like something\Nis happening on the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.72,0:32:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who has the upper hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.08,0:32:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps the battle is injured with\Na bang and only one fighter remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.98,0:32:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.89,0:32:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see dead people.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.48,0:32:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But only one of them is\Nstanding! And it's... Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.74,0:32:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.02,0:32:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.72,0:32:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.44,0:33:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, it looks like Straw\NHat has been burned to a crisp!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.86,0:33:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have taken some\Nseriously hot punches!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.36,0:33:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.80,0:33:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.90,0:33:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes more than punches\Nto burn someone like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.54,0:33:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.45,0:33:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.52,0:33:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's out! I can't stall!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.52,0:33:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that is up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.80,0:33:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seemed like he was down for\Nthe count, but the fight goes on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.04,0:33:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.00,0:33:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you that much, Rubber Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.10,0:33:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Afro Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.52,0:33:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.78,0:33:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finish him, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.16,0:33:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the slow beam sword\Nas I'm sure you can probably
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.04,0:33:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tell I've restrained your arms\Nand legs good luck with that
Dialogue: 1,0:34:03.67,0:34:06.21,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Megaton Nine-Tails Rush!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:06.67,0:34:08.03,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rush!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:08.77,0:34:10.21,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rush!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:10.99,0:34:12.35,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rush!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:12.43,0:34:13.39,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.94,0:34:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.70,0:34:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's down for sure this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.74,0:34:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.04,0:34:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.88,0:34:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.92,0:34:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.86,0:34:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.30,0:34:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.48,0:34:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They shouldn't have\Nlet him have that afro.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.44,0:34:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody can stop him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.84,0:34:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stubborn brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.50,0:34:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:49.01,0:34:50.29,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow-Slow Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.54,0:34:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another slush the beans!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:52.63,0:34:54.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Megaton Nine-Tails Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.78,0:34:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megaton Ninetales Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.20,0:35:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That beam is for cheaters!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.44,0:35:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try fighting like a man for once!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.22,0:35:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.14,0:35:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks like the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.32,0:35:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dealing the punches ain't\Nso easy either, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.50,0:35:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's beating Lupi to death out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.16,0:35:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's giving up again!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.04,0:35:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.12,0:35:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you take a single member\Nof my crew, even if it kills me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.16,0:36:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's on his feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.16,0:36:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy refuses to give it up!

